---
import HeroFilm from "./HeroFilm.astro";
---

<figure class="overview-stage hero-story-stage" aria-label="How Movcues turns user behavior into contextual onboarding">
  <HeroFilm />
  <figcaption class="story-caption" id="hero-film-caption">
    <strong>One workflow, from insight to action.</strong>
    Find onboarding drop-offs with <a href="/product/analytics">behavior analytics</a>,
    segment users by their actions, deliver <a href="/product/experiences">contextual experiences</a>,
    and evaluate completion to decide what to improve next.
  </figcaption>
  <details class="story-transcript">
    <summary>Read the film transcript</summary>
    <p><strong>0:00 — The hook.</strong> Your users signed up. But never came back. Dots representing users follow a curved path and progressively disappear.</p>
    <p><strong>0:03 — Understand.</strong> Know where they get stuck. The surviving dot becomes an interruption point in a simplified behavior journey.</p>
    <p><strong>0:06 — Target.</strong> Find the users who need help. A geometric audience grid highlights and connects only the selected users.</p>
    <p><strong>0:09 — Guide.</strong> Give them the next step. A contextual tooltip points to Create project in a fictional workspace. A cursor selects the action and a checkmark confirms completion.</p>
    <p><strong>0:13 — Measure.</strong> See what happens next. The checkmark transforms into an abstract progress path and an illustrative completion signal.</p>
    <p><strong>0:16 — Movcues.</strong> Turn user behavior into action. Understand. Target. Guide. Improve.</p>
    <p class="transcript-note">Abstract behavior illustrations and a fictional workspace demonstrate the workflow.</p>
  </details>
</figure>

<style>
  .hero-story-stage { display: block; min-height: 0; margin: 0; padding: clamp(.6rem, 1.8vw, 1.6rem); }
  .hero-story-stage::before { pointer-events: none; }
  .story-caption { max-width: 730px; margin: 20px auto 4px; color: #65738c; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; text-align: center; }
  .story-caption strong { display: block; color: #273652; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 550; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .story-caption a { color: #3156c8; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .story-transcript { max-width: 730px; margin: 14px auto 4px; color: #65738c; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .story-transcript summary { width: fit-content; margin: auto; color: #3156c8; cursor: pointer; }
  .story-transcript summary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #3156c8; outline-offset: 4px; }
  .story-transcript p { margin: 12px 0; }
  .story-transcript strong { color: #273652; }
  .transcript-note { font-style: italic; }
</style>
